OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry around dawn but
OL,6,FStorm Boelo will soon arrive to bring
OL,7,Frain and strengthening winds. A breezy
OL,8,Fmorning with spots of rain will become
OL,9,Fmore unpleasant in the afternoon with
OL,10,Fpersistent rain, sometimes heavy,
OL,11,Fstrong winds and isolated gales.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FGale force gusts possible as
OL,14,Fa line of showers passes through
OL,15,Fduring the evening. Drying up for most
OL,16,Fafterwards with only the odd shower
OL,17,Faround overnight. Remaining widely
OL,18,Fwindy overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
